pageType: content
background: {type: solid, color: "$bg"}
notes: 核心业务逻辑第二页：资金与信誉。讲信誉分规则表、评价修改删除时的差额回滚、结算只纳入无争议记录。
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 30, 500, 20]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: 06 · 核心业务逻辑 ②}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 50, 700, 42]
    content: {style: "$pagetitle", wrap: false, text: 资金链路与信誉分联动}
  - elementId: titlebar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 100, 56, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: gradient, gradientType: linear, angle: 0, stops: [{position: 0, color: "$primary"}, {position: 1, color: "$teal"}]}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 60, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, middle], wrap: false, text: 07 / 12}
  - elementId: creditlabel
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 126, 400, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 15, color: "$dark", bold: true, wrap: false, text: 评价 → 跑腿员信誉分规则}
  - elementId: credittable
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 156, 404, 186]
    columnWidths: [0.25, 0.375, 0.375]
    rowHeights: [0.19, 0.162, 0.162, 0.162, 0.162, 0.162]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - text: 评分
        - text: 信誉变动
        - text: 业务含义
      - - text: ★★★★★
        - {text: "+2", color: "$teal", bold: true}
        - text: 优质服务奖励
      - - text: ★★★★
        - {text: "+1", color: "$teal", bold: true}
        - text: 良好
      - - text: ★★★
        - {text: "0", color: "$subtext", bold: true}
        - text: 中性
      - - text: ★★
        - {text: "-1", color: "$accent", bold: true}
        - text: 警告
      - - text: ★
        - {text: "-2", color: "#DC2626", bold: true}
        - text: 差评惩戒
  - elementId: creditnote
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 352, 404, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 12.5
      color: "$subtext"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>信誉分下限 0：GREATEST(0, score + delta)，不会扣成负数</p>
  - elementId: chainlabel
    elementType: text
    bounds: [496, 126, 400, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 15, color: "$dark", bold: true, wrap: false, text: 支付 → 退款 → 结算的账务链路}
  - elementId: chainbg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [496, 156, 404, 100]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [9000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$white"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}
  - elementId: chaintext
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 168, 364, 76]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><strong>payments</strong>（已支付）→ <strong>refunds</strong>（审批拦截）→ <strong>settlements</strong>（跑腿员结算）</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px"><span style="color:$subtext">结算只纳入：已支付 + 已完成 + 无争议 + 未结算的记录，多条件 SQL 过滤</span></p>
  - elementId: txnlabel
    elementType: text
    bounds: [496, 276, 400, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 15, color: "$dark", bold: true, wrap: false, text: 事务一致性示例：评价入库 + 信誉分更新}
  - elementId: txnbg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [496, 306, 404, 104]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [9000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$dark"}
  - elementId: txntext
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 312, 364, 92]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#DCE7F5"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      fontFamily: {latin: "Consolas", ea: "MiSans"}
      text: |
        <p>BEGIN TRANSACTION</p>
        <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;INSERT reviews …            -- ① 评价入库</p>
        <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;UPDATE runners SET credit …   -- ② 信誉联动</p>
        <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;-- ②失败 → ROLLBACK，①不落库</p>
        <p>COMMIT</p>
  - elementId: editnote
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 416, 840, 92]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FDF3E0"}
  - elementId: editnotetext
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 430, 800, 66]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$accent"><strong>细节见功底：</strong></span>评价允许修改与删除，但信誉分不重来——按"新旧评分差额"做增量调整，删除时等额回滚；</p>
        <p>每次调整记录实际生效的 credit_delta，配合 GREATEST 下限保护，账务永远对得上。</p>
